Fixed `counter.rs`.

**Change** (`/home/skynet/1-agent/docs/evidence/phase4-2026-11-23/workspaces/pi/run-3/bug-fix-last-index/counter.rs`):

```rust
// before
pub fn last_index(len: usize) -> usize {
    len
}

// after
pub fn last_index(len: usize) -> usize {
    len.saturating_sub(1)
}
```

Line 2 now returns `len - 1`, the last valid index for a non-empty slice, and `saturating_sub(1)` safely returns `0` instead of underflowing when `len == 0`.
